#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:2
msgid "Server Placement"
msgstr "Server Placement"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:7
msgid ""
"Server Placement in |morpheus| controls which host, cluster, or resource "
"pool a virtual machine is assigned to within a cloud. Placement "
"configuration can be set during provisioning or updated post-provisioning to"
" optimize resource utilization across the infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Servidor Placement en |morpheus| controls cual host, cluster, o recurso pool"
" un virtual machine es asignado un dentro de un cloud. Placement "
"configuración se puede establecer durante provisioning o actualizado post-"
"provisioning a optimize recurso utilization a través de el infrastructure."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:9
msgid ""
"Placement settings work in conjunction with cloud resource pool "
"configurations and can be influenced by Host-VM Groups (affinity and anti-"
"affinity rules)."
msgstr ""
"Placement configuraciones funcionar en conjunction con cloud recurso pool "
"configurations y puede be influenced por Host-VM Grupos (affinity y anti-"
"affinity reglas)."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:12
msgid "Configuring Placement"
msgstr "Configuring Placement"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:15
msgid "During Provisioning"
msgstr "Durante Provisioning"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:17
msgid ""
"When provisioning a new instance, placement is configured in the "
"**Configure** step:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando provisioning un nuevo instance, placement está configurado en el "
"**Configure** paso:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:19
#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:36
msgid "CLOUD"
msgstr "CLOUD"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:20
msgid "The target cloud determines available placement options."
msgstr "El destino cloud determines disponible placement opciones."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:21
#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:39
msgid "RESOURCE POOL"
msgstr "RESOURCE POOL"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:22
msgid ""
"Select a resource pool or cluster. This defines the boundary within which "
"the VM will be placed."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar un recurso pool o cluster. Este define el boundary dentro de "
"cual el VM será be placed."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:24
msgid "HOST"
msgstr "HOST"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:24
msgid ""
"(Optional) When manual host selection is enabled, a specific host can be "
"chosen. If left as auto-select, |morpheus| or the hypervisor will determine "
"optimal placement."
msgstr ""
"(Opcional) Cuando manual host selection está habilitado, un específico host "
"puede be chosen. Si left como auto-seleccionar, |morpheus| o el hypervisor "
"será determine optimal placement."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:27
msgid "Updating Placement Post-Provisioning"
msgstr "Updating Placement Post-Aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:29
msgid "To change a server's placement after provisioning:"
msgstr "A cambiar un servidor's placement después de provisioning:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:31
msgid "Navigate to the server detail page"
msgstr "Navegue un el server detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:32
msgid "Click :guilabel:`ACTIONS`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`ACCIONES`"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:33
msgid "Select **Change Cloud** or **Placement**"
msgstr "Seleccionar **Change Nube** o **Placement**"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:34
msgid "Update the placement configuration:"
msgstr "Update el placement configuración:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:37
msgid "The target cloud (for cross-cloud placement changes)."
msgstr "El destino cloud (para cross-cloud placement cambios)."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:39
msgid "The destination resource pool or cluster."
msgstr "El destino recurso pool o cluster."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:41
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:43
msgid ""
"Changing placement may trigger a migration operation depending on the "
"hypervisor. See :doc:`server_migration` for details on VM migration."
msgstr ""
"Changing placement puede trigger un migración operación dependiendo de el "
"hypervisor. Ver :doc:`server_migration` para details en VM migración."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:46
msgid "Automatic Placement"
msgstr "Automático Placement"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:48
msgid ""
"When no specific host is selected, |morpheus| works with the underlying "
"hypervisor's placement engine:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando no específico host es seleccionado, |morpheus| funciona con el "
"underlying hypervisor's placement engine:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:50
msgid ""
"**VMware DRS** — When DRS is enabled, VMware handles optimal host placement "
"within a cluster."
msgstr ""
"**VMware DRS** — Cuando DRS está habilitado, VMware handles optimal host "
"placement dentro de un cluster."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Nutanix ADS** — Acropolis Dynamic Scheduling distributes VMs across hosts."
msgstr ""
"**Nutanix ADS** — Acropolis Dinámico Scheduling distributes VMs a través de "
"hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:52
msgid ""
"**KVM/MVM** — |morpheus| selects the host with the most available resources "
"in the target pool."
msgstr ""
"**KVM/MVM** — |morpheus| selects el host con el más disponible recursos en "
"el destino pool."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:55
msgid "Host-VM Group Integration"
msgstr "Host-VM Group Integration"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:57
msgid ""
"Server placement can be further controlled through Host-VM Groups, which "
"define affinity and anti-affinity rules. See "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups` for details on configuring "
"these rules."
msgstr ""
"Servidor placement puede be further controlled a través de Host-VM Grupos, "
"cual define affinity y anti-affinity reglas. Ver "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/host_vm_groups` para details en configuring "
"estos reglas."
